$965
{"role": "assistant", "content": "The document is a pragmatic playbook for onboarding customers onto\u202fSLO\u2011driven fidelity tiers. It explains how customer latency, availability and correctness\u202fSLOs map to recommended fidelity tiers, lists the telemetry that must be collected, the operational checks to run, and provides a step\u2011by\u2011step checklist for commercial and technical leads when contracting dedicated or private deployments or migrating high\u2011usage tenants\u202f[chunk-2].  \n\nIt also includes an example\u202ffidelity\u2011profile.json\u202fshowing fields such as\u202fname, quantization, max_batch_tokens, kv_cache_policy\u202fand\u202ffallback_variant\u202f[chunk-19].  \n\nFinally, the appendix gives a sample sign\u2011off rubric that defines the product, SRE and CS sign\u2011off criteria (quality delta thresholds, staging smoke tests, runbooks, on\u2011call briefings, and customer acceptance test plan)\u202f[chunk-24]."}
