{"role": "assistant", "content": "The onboarding playbook lists the following legal\u2011 and commercial\u2011alignment steps:\n\n- **Confirm the target SLOs**, the billing model (usage\u2011based or reserved), and any trial period.  \n- **Document the commitments** in a contract or CD appendix, making sure to include fallback and rollback terms.  \n\nThese items are part of the \u201cLegal / Commercial alignment\u201d checkpoint in the operational checklist\u3010chunk-12\u3011.  \n\nNo additional responsibilities for commercial or technical leads, product, SRE, or Customer\u2011Success teams are specified in the provided context."}
