$790
{"role": "assistant", "content": "The onboarding playbook lists three primary goals:\n\n1.\u202fProvide a repeatable alignment process that converts customer SLAs\u2014such as latency, availability, and correctness targets\u2014into recommended fidelity packages.  \n2.\u202fEnsure operational readiness (including telemetry collection, runbooks, and rollback procedures) before committing to a fidelity\u2011onboarding date.  \n3.\u202fMinimize regressions in perceived quality while keeping unit cost under the negotiated budget.  \n\nThese goals focus on mapping SLOs (latency, availability, correctness) to fidelity tiers, guaranteeing the necessary telemetry and operational checks are in place, and establishing sign\u2011off criteria that protect quality and budget.\u202f[chunk-5]"}
