**Decision thresholds for offers**

| Offer confidence level | Score range (aggregate / candidate_score) | Compensation stretch vs. band midpoint | Required sign‑offs |
|------------------------|-------------------------------------------|----------------------------------------|--------------------|
| **High‑confidence** (auto‑approve) | ≥ 4.0 | ≤ +10 % | Recruiter + HRBP (finalize)【chunk-13】【chunk-9】 |
| **Moderate‑confidence** | 3.0 – 3.9 (or 3.0 – 4.0 in the matrix) | > +10 % – ≤ +25 % | Hiring Manager + HRBP【chunk-13】【chunk-9】 |
| **High‑risk** | < 3.0 | > +25 % (or any atypical clause) | Finance + Legal + Executive sponsor【chunk-13】【chunk-9】 |

These thresholds combine the aggregate score and the proposed compensation stretch to determine which stakeholders must approve the offer.
