|------------------------|--------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------|-----------------------|
| **High‑confidence** (auto‑approved) | Aggregate (candidate) score **≥ 4.0** | **≤ +10 %** of the band midpoint | Recruiter **+** HR Business Partner (finalize) [chunk‑9] |
| **Moderate‑confidence** | Aggregate score **3.0 – 3.9** **or** compensation **> +10 % – ≤ +25 %** | **> +10 % – ≤ +25 %** of the band midpoint | Hiring Manager **+** HR Business Partner [chunk‑13][chunk‑9] |
| **High‑risk** | Aggregate score **< 3.0** **or** compensation **> +25 %** (or atypical clauses) | **> +25 %** of the band midpoint | Finance **+** Legal **+** Executive sponsor [chunk‑13][chunk‑9] |

These thresholds combine the score ranges (0‑5 scale) and the permitted compensation stretch percentages to determine which stakeholders must approve the offer.
